sequenceDiagram
  participant A as A Platform (ESP32 + bridge)
  participant C as C Vision
  participant D as D Auto Controller
  participant E as E Control Station
  Note over A,E: programs connect to the broker
  E->>E: GameManager enters setup
  E->>C: cs/command calibrate_camera, read_maze
  C->>E: vision/maze, plan/distance_map (retained)
  C->>D: vision/maze, plan/distance_map
  loop every camera frame
    C->>D: vision/ball, plan/route
    C->>E: vision/ball, plan/route
  end
  E->>E: valid maze, path to exit, distance map → ready
  E->>E: Recorder opens <game_id>.jsonl
  E->>E: operator selects the mode
  E->>A: game/state (ready, mode)
  Note over E: ball in the start cell, playfield clear
  E->>A: start → game/state (playing)
